Data.DatabaseSchemes:
CREATE TABLE security_findings (
    finding_id VARCHAR(255) PRIMARY KEY,
    cloud_resource_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    severity VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    description TEXT,
    detection_timestamp TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE TABLE cloud_accounts (
    account_id VARCHAR(255) PRIMARY KEY,
    account_name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    provider VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    status VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE compliance_rules (
    rule_id VARCHAR(255) PRIMARY KEY,
    rule_name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    standard VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    description TEXT
);

Storage Technology Summary: A combination of a relational database (e.g., PostgreSQL) for structured metadata and configuration data, and a data lake (e.g., S3 or ADLS) for raw scan data and historical logs, enabling scalable storage and analytical queries.
